2. Core Runtime Loop\par
\par
The engine loop should work like this:\par
\par
function update(deltaTime) \{\par
  inputSystem.update()\par
\par
  physicsSystem.step(deltaTime)\par
\par
  animationSystem.update(deltaTime)\par
\par
  constraintSystem.solve()\par
\par
  sceneGraph.update()\par
\par
  renderer.render(scene, camera)\par
\}\par
3. Scene Graph System\par
\par
Everything is a node.\par
\par
Node Structure\par
class SceneNode \{\par
  id: string\par
  name: string\par
\par
  parent: SceneNode | null\par
  children: SceneNode[]\par
\par
  transform: Transform\par
\par
