9. Browser Performance Strategy\par
\par
Critical.\par
\par
3D + physics can become extremely expensive.\par
\par
Main Performance Principles\par
A. Instancing\par
\par
Duplicate objects efficiently.\par
\par
B. Level of Detail (LOD)\par
\par
Reduce geometry at distance.\par
\par
C. Occlusion Culling\par
\par
Don\rquote t render hidden objects.\par
\par
D. Physics Sleep States\par
\par
Inactive bodies stop updating.\par
\par
E. GPU Texture Compression\par
\par
Use compressed textures.\par
\par
Use WebAssembly\par
\par
Physics should run in WASM.\par
